# 🚢 Titanic Dataset — Exploratory Data Analysis & Data Visualization

This repository contains my work for the **Neurofive Solutions Machine Learning Internship Track**.

The project uses the **Titanic dataset** to practice the fundamentals of data science, including Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA), data cleaning, missing-value handling, outlier detection, and data visualization.

